# FastAPI LWN PoC — framework from public PyPI; httpx from Lightwell Validated.
#
# GitHub filename is requirements.txt.example so Dependabot does not bump
# workshop pins (httpx==0.27.2 Validated line). Gitea seed renames this to
# requirements.txt.
#
# Dual dependency streams (mirror of Java commons-lang3):
#   - Default / Validated labs: httpx==0.27.2 from lightwell-python-validated
#   - Remediated labs (Module 8): install lw-workshop-pypi==1.0.0+rhlw.00001
#     via pip-remediated.conf (gated; not a runtime import of this app)
#
# Packaging note: this workshop uses requirements.txt (common client pip/Tekton UX).
# A future pyproject.toml port should keep the same httpx pin and a pip-installable
# path for Showroom — see chart README.

